          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## UnitedHealthcare\n\nWe are in-network with UnitedHealthcare Choice Plus and UnitedHealthcare Options PPO. UnitedHealthcare Navigate HMO is not in-network. AARP Medicare Advanta",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 36,
